# @sentry/vite-plugin reads this file at build time and Object.assign's it over process.env
# (#130). It is where Sentry's own wizard and docs put SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN, and it does NOT
# match `*.local` above — so without this line the default filename for a real secret is
# tracked in a public repo.
.env.sentry-build-plugin

